#: krandrmodule.cpp:72
msgid ""
"<qt>Sorry, your X server does not support resizing and rotating the display. "
"Please update to version 4.3 or greater.  You need the X Resize And Rotate "
"extension (RANDR) version 1.1 or greater to use this feature.  Error code: %"
"1</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Maaf, pelayan X anda tidak menyokong paparan saiz semula dan putar paparan."
"Sila naik taraf ke 4.3 atau lebih. Anda perlukan sambungan X Resize dan Rotate "
"(RANDR) versi 1.1 atau lebih untuk gunakan ciri-ciri ini. Kod ralat: %"
"1</qt>"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:80
msgid "Settings for screen:"
msgstr "Tetapan untuk skrin:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:84 krandrtray.cpp:73 krandrtray.cpp:78
#, c-format
msgid "Screen %1"
msgstr "Skrin %1"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:88
msgid ""
"The screen whose settings you would like to change can be selected using "
"this drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"Tetapan bagi tetapan skrin yang mahu anda ubah boleh dipilih menggunakan senarai "
"jatuh-bawah."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:97
msgid "Screen size:"
msgstr "Saiz skrin:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:99
msgid ""
"The size, otherwise known as the resolution, of your screen can be selected "
"from this drop-down list."
msgstr "Saiz, atau dikenali sebagai resolusi bagi skrin boleh dipilih dari senarai jatuh-bawah ini."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:104
msgid "Refresh rate:"
msgstr "Kadar segar-semula:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:106
msgid "The refresh rate of your screen can be selected from this drop-down list."
msgstr "Kadar segar semula skrin anda boleh dipilih daripada senarai jatuh-bawah."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:109
msgid "Orientation (degrees counterclockwise)"
msgstr "Orientasi (darjah antipusinganjam)"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:112
msgid "The options in this section allow you to change the rotation of your screen."
msgstr "Pilihan di dalam seksyen ini akan membenarkan anda untuk memutar paparan skrin anda."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:114
msgid "Apply settings on KDE startup"
msgstr "Terap tetapan pada permulaak KDE"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled the size and orientation settings will be used "
"when KDE starts."
msgstr "Jika pilihan ini dibolehkan, tetapan saiz dan orientasi akan digunakan semasa KDE bermula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:121
msgid "Allow tray application to change startup settings"
msgstr "Benarkan dulang aplikasi untuk ubah tetapan permulaan"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:123
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, options set by the system tray applet will be "
"saved and loaded when KDE starts instead of being temporary."
msgstr ""
"Jika pilihan ini dibolehkan, pilihan ditetapkan oleh aplet dulang sistem akan disimpan dan "
"dimuatkan semasa KDE bermula dan bukan sementara lagi."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:160 krandrtray.cpp:115
msgid "%1 x %2"
msgstr "%1 x %2"

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Application is being auto-started at KDE session start"
msgstr "Aplikasi akan dimulakan secara auto pada permulaan sesi KDE"

#: main.cpp:38
msgid "Resize and Rotate"
msgstr "Saiz Semula dan Putar"

#: main.cpp:38
msgid "Resize and Rotate System Tray App"
msgstr "Aplikasi Dulang Sistem Saiz Semula dan Putar"

#: main.cpp:39
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Penyelenggara"

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Many fixes"
msgstr "Banyak pemulihan"

#: krandrtray.cpp:63
msgid "Display Configuration"
msgstr "Penyelarasan Paparan"

#: krandrtray.cpp:66
msgid "Required X Extension Not Available"
msgstr "Sambungan X Diperlukan Tiada"

#: krandrtray.cpp:101
msgid "Screen configuration has changed"
msgstr "Penyelarasan skrin telah berubah"

#: krandrtray.cpp:112
msgid "Screen Size"
msgstr "Saiz Skrin"

#: krandrtray.cpp:149
msgid "Refresh Rate"
msgstr "Kadar Pulih Semula"

